===Etymology===
Mentioned in the 11th century in Sanskrit as ''Sumatra-bhumi'' "land of Sumatra", gradually replacing the earlier ''Svarna-dvīpa''.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# The largest island of [[Indonesia]].

